# queries.txt.example — LeadHunter Pro example query file
#
# Copy to queries.txt and add your own queries (one per line).
# Lines starting with # are comments and are ignored.
#
#   cp queries.txt.example queries.txt
#
# Tips:
#   - Be specific: include the service type AND location
#   - Use natural language phrases, not keyword lists
#   - Vary location specificity for broader coverage
#   - 20–50 queries is a good starting point for a full run

block management companies London
residential block management Manchester
letting agents Birmingham city centre
property management companies Leeds
facilities management companies Bristol
